<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 700 million.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 700 million.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 700 million pounds for auction on March 10 and issue on March 11 when 182-day bills worth 739.550 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 9.987 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.40 pounds)</p>
